### BIG SHAPE, 4 agent panes

VAR  ELEMENT                    SxWxP    PANES VIS  LOAD   N   p50   p95   max   >1s  cpu%
V0   control (no cockpit formats) 5x20x4   400   4    agent  4   8 11 20 0 13
V2   pane-border-format, banner REMOVED 5x20x4   400   4    agent  4   8 14 19 0 18
V3   pane-border-format WITH banner 5x20x4   400   4    agent  4   47 104 193 0 69
V4   window tabs (5x #{P:} walks) 5x20x4   400   4    agent  4   10 23 42 0 36
V5   status-right #{agent_fleet} 5x20x4   400   4    agent  4   11 25 85 0 49
V6   window-style tint          5x20x4   400   4    agent  4   7 13 21 0 14
V7   FULL shipped config        5x20x4   400   4    agent  4   113 143 150 0 82

### BIG SHAPE, 12 agent panes

VAR  ELEMENT                    SxWxP    PANES VIS  LOAD   N   p50   p95   max   >1s  cpu%
V0   control (no cockpit formats) 5x20x4   400   4    agent  12  9 14 24 0 29
V3   pane-border-format WITH banner 5x20x4   400   4    agent  12  83 101 107 0 78
V7   FULL shipped config        5x20x4   400   4    agent  12  137 154 164 0 83

### TITLE-ONLY vs LINES-ONLY (120 panes)

VAR  ELEMENT                    SxWxP    PANES VIS  LOAD   N   p50   p95   max   >1s  cpu%
V0   control (no cockpit formats) 3x10x4   120   4    spam   4   5 7 11 0 3
V7   FULL shipped config        3x10x4   120   4    spam   4   5 7 10 0 3

VAR  ELEMENT                    SxWxP    PANES VIS  LOAD   N   p50   p95   max   >1s  cpu%
V0   control (no cockpit formats) 3x10x4   120   4    title  4   5 7 10 0 7
V7   FULL shipped config        3x10x4   120   4    title  4   6 26 52 0 33
